<h1>Dax 3.9.1</h1>
<ul>
<li><strong>Dax Companion</strong>, the mobile app for Dax, is on the App Store for iPhone and iPad: <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/dax-companion/id6828041761">get it here</a>, then pair from the phone at the bottom of the sidebar.</li>
<li>No app on the phone yet? The pairing screen has a “Get Dax Companion” link that swaps in a code to open it on the App Store, and Settings › iPhone &amp; iPad links there too.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>On Dax 3.3 or earlier?</strong> Install this release once using the
<a href="https://github.com/DaxOrg/public.macos.getdax.app/releases/download/v3.9.1/Dax.pkg">Dax installer</a>.
It preserves your saved work and brings you straight to 3.9.1.</p>
</body></html>
